    [Doc][Feature] Add documentation for Qwen3.6-27B-w8a8c8-mxfp8 and W8A8C8 FAQ (#18175)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This PR adds documentation and deployment guidelines for the newly
    supported `Qwen3.6-27B-w8a8c8-mxfp8` quantized model. It includes
    hardware requirements, a brief description, and a detailed FAQ section
    explaining how to use the W8A8C8 quantized weights with the
    `--kv-cache-dtype mxfp8` parameter.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No, this is a documentation-only update.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
